WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:09.484
The first time a manager signs in, they create their workspace. This tutorial uses

2
00:00:09.484 --> 00:00:11.865
fictional demonstration data.

3
00:00:12.324 --> 00:00:15.648
Upload a logo, if you have one.

4
00:00:16.112 --> 00:00:21.336
Type the workspace name. The address fills in from the name.

5
00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:28.147
You can shorten the address. Crewflow checks that it is available, then select

6
00:00:28.147 --> 00:00:29.533
Create workspace.

7
00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:37.646
Next, create your profile so your team knows who you are, then select Complete

8
00:00:37.646 --> 00:00:38.152
setup.

9
00:00:39.742 --> 00:00:46.560
Crewflow prepares your workspace. It only opens once everything is genuinely ready.

10
00:00:48.179 --> 00:00:52.568
Your workspace is ready, and you land on your Dashboard.
